/Title (In an Arduino program, first we define the pins or variables. This means we give a name to a pin number so it is easy to use in the code. For example, if we write int ledPin = 5;, it means we are using pin number 5 and calling it ledPin.)
/Dest [17 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 1420 0 R
/Next 1424 0 R
>>
endobj
