<<
/Title (After that comes the loop\(\) function. This part runs again and again forever, so the Arduino keeps checking or controlling the circuit continuously.)
/Dest [17 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 1424 0 R
/Next 1428 0 R
>>
endobj
