/Title (So overall, the program first prepares everything in setup\(\), then keeps running the loop continuously, controlling devices using functions like pinMode\(\), digitalWrite\(\), and analogWrite\(\).)
/Dest [17 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 1428 0 R
/Next 1429 0 R
